    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d335">

                <pb facs="0763" n="737" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v10/pg737"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Eisenhower Library, Dulles papers, “Telephone
                    Conversations”</note>
                <head>No. 335<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Telephone Conversation, by
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            type="conversation-or-meeting-date" when="1953-07-24T10:55:00-04:00"
                            >July 24, 1953—10:55 a.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Telephone Conversation With Allen
                        W. Dulles</hi></p>
                <p>The Secy called and said in your talk about Iran yesterday at the meeting<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d335-f1"/> you did not mention the other matter, is it off?
                    AWD said he doesn’t talk about it, it was cleared directly with the President,
                    and is still active.</p>
                <p>The Secy asked if that relieved us of trying anything else, or if there was any
                    alternative. AWD is getting up a paper,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d335-f2"/> a hint
                    from the Department that we are deeply disturbed at the apparent acquiescence,
                        <pb facs="0764" n="738" xml:id="pg738"/> etc. might help, there is
                    sufficient evidence on the thing, he quoted a statement about the riots in which
                    Mossadegh said you cannot crush the will of the people, look what happened in
                    China.</p>
                <p>His paper will be an outline of things that have happened and it would benefit
                    the project if we express apprehension because he is leaning more and more on
                    Tudeh. The Secretary remarked that he hasn’t any other place to lean. AWD said
                    it is moving along reasonably well but the young many [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >man</hi>] may pull out at the last minute, he is an unaccountable character
                    but the sister has agreed to go.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
